eddedOS\" property=\"article:tag\"><meta content=\"Open Source\" property=\"article:tag\"><meta content=\"https://www.embeddedos.org/article-foundation-membership-2026\" property=\"og:url\"><meta content=\"https://www.embeddedos.org/img/og-cover.svg\" property=\"og:image\"><meta content=\"1200\" property=\"og:image:width\"><meta content=\"630\" property=\"og:image:height\"><meta content=\"EmbeddedOS\" property=\"og:site_name\"><meta content=\"summary_large_image\" name=\"twitter:card\"><meta content=\"Foundation 2026 membership: governance, voting, working groups — EmbeddedOS\" name=\"twitter:title\"><meta content=\"The 2026 membership cycle opens with three new working groups (Safety-Certified, Embedded AI Ethics, and Neural Interface Standards) and a refreshed governance charter. Here's what changed and how to participate.\" name=\"twitter:description\"><meta content=\"https://www.embeddedos.org/img/og-cover.svg\" name=\"twitter:image\"><link href=\"https://www.embeddedos.org/article-foundation-membership-2026\" rel=\"canonical\"><link href=\"img/logo.svg\" rel=\"apple-touch-icon\"><title>Foundation 2026 Membership &amp; Governance | EmbeddedOS</title>\n <script type=\"application/ld+json\">\n{\n    \"@context\": \"https://schema.org\",\n    \"@graph\": [\n        {\n            \"@type\": \"Article\",\n            \"headline\": \"Foundation 2026 membership: governance, voting, working groups\",\n            \"description\": \"The 2026 membership cycle opens with three new working groups (Safety-Certified, Embedded AI Ethics, and Neural Interface Standards) and a refreshed governance charter. Here's what changed and how to participate.\",\n            \"datePublished\": \"2026-04-29\",\n            \"dateModified\": \"2026-04-29\",\n            \"author\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n                \"name\": \"EoS Editorial\"\n            },\n            \"publisher\": {\n                \"@type\": \"Organization\",\n                \"name\":